2##ahem
1##emote looks around.
3##say This poem is entitled "Whimsy".
3##say Little Stone met Big, Big Rock,
2##say Rolling along one day.
2##say Little Stone saw Big, Big Rock..
2##say Was squarely in its way.
2##say Little Stone got huffy it..
2##say Did not want to go 'round,
2##say So Little Stone grabbed Big, Big Rock,
2##say And tossed it to the ground.
2##emote pauses for dramatic effect.
2##say Little Stone, it would have laughed,
2##say As it kept on its walk,
2##say But Little Stone, it didn't, because..
2##say Little Stones can't talk.
4##emote glances around, noticing the lack of applause.
2##bow awkwardly
1##@stop_poem
1##END
